      Snowside is a project by <strong>0xShomari</strong> (creator of NodΞRunr).
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm list-none">
      <li class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <a href="https://x.com/AvalancheFDN/status/1932484367324229635?s=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-0 px-3 py-1.5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-surface-1 transition">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 22 L12 2 L22 22 Z M7 16 L12 8 L17 16 Z" fill="#e84142"/>
