      </a>
      <a href="https://x.com/AvalancheFDN/status/1932484367324229635?s=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block rounded-full px-4 py-1 bg-surface-1 border border-white/10 text-snow-300 text-xs font-medium self-center hover:bg-surface-2 transition">
        Avalanche Foundation Grant Recipient
      </a>
